#: members/views.py:709
msgid ""
"Learn how to create an account, complete your profile and start searching."
msgstr ""
"Jifunze jinsi ya kutengeneza akaunti, kukamilisha wasifu na kuanza kutafuta."

#: members/views.py:710
msgid "How do I start?"
msgstr "Naanzaje?"

#: members/views.py:710
msgid ""
"Join free, complete your profile with a clear photo, set your partner "
"preferences, then use Find a Match."
msgstr ""
"Jiunge bure, kamilisha wasifu wako kwa picha iliyo wazi, weka mapendeleo ya "
"mwenza, kisha tumia Tafuta Mwenza."

#: members/views.py:711
msgid "Is Sakinah free?"
msgstr "Je, Sakinah ni bure?"

#: members/views.py:711
msgid ""
"Yes. Creating a profile, searching and sending likes are free. Premium plans"
" add more features."
msgstr ""
"Ndiyo. Kutengeneza wasifu, kutafuta na kutuma kupenda ni bure. Vifurushi vya"
" Premium vinaongeza vipengele zaidi."

#: members/views.py:712
msgid "Profile & Verification"
msgstr "Wasifu na Uthibitisho"

#: members/views.py:712
msgid "How to verify your profile, upload photos and keep your account safe."
msgstr ""
"Jinsi ya kuthibitisha wasifu, kupakia picha na kuweka akaunti yako salama."

#: members/views.py:713
msgid "How do I get verified?"
msgstr "Nathibitishwaje?"

#: members/views.py:713
msgid ""
"Go to My Profile > Verification and send a request with a photo of your ID. "
"Our team reviews it."
msgstr ""
"Nenda Wasifu Wangu > Uthibitisho na utume ombi pamoja na picha ya "
"kitambulisho chako. Timu yetu italikagua."

#: members/views.py:714
msgid "How many photos can I add?"
msgstr "Naweza kuongeza picha ngapi?"

#: members/views.py:714
msgid "Up to 6 photos. Use clear, recent and modest photos."
msgstr "Hadi picha 6. Tumia picha zilizo wazi, za karibuni na za staha."

#: members/views.py:715
msgid "Finding a Match"
msgstr "Kumpata Mwenza"

#: members/views.py:715
msgid "Tips on using search filters, likes, messages and matches."
msgstr ""
"Vidokezo vya kutumia vichujio vya utafutaji, kupenda, ujumbe na ulinganisho."

#: members/views.py:716
msgid "What is a mutual match?"
msgstr "Mlinganisho wa pande zote ni nini?"

#: members/views.py:716
msgid ""
"When you like someone and they like you back, it becomes a mutual match."
msgstr "Ukimpenda mtu naye akakupenda, huo unakuwa mlinganisho wa pande zote."

#: members/views.py:717
msgid "Why can't I message someone?"
msgstr "Kwa nini siwezi kumtumia mtu ujumbe?"

#: members/views.py:717
msgid ""
"Some members only accept messages from verified or matched members. Check "
"their profile."
msgstr ""
"Baadhi ya wanachama hupokea ujumbe kutoka kwa waliothibitishwa au "
"mliolingana pekee. Angalia wasifu wao."

