"Enter the <b>email, username or phone number</b> on your account. We will "
"email you a link to choose a new password."
msgstr ""
"Weka <b>barua pepe, jina la mtumiaji au namba ya simu</b> ya akaunti yako. "
"Tutakutumia barua pepe yenye kiungo cha kuchagua nenosiri jipya."

#: templates/registration/password_reset_form.html:4
msgid "Send reset link"
msgstr "Tuma kiungo"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_form.html:5
msgid "Remembered it?"
msgstr "Umelikumbuka?"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:1
#, python-format
msgid "Join Free - %(brand)s"
msgstr "Jiunge Bure - %(brand)s"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:3
msgid "Anza safari yako"
msgstr "Anza safari yako"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:3
msgid ""
"Create your free profile and meet verified people who are serious about "
"marriage."
msgstr ""
"Tengeneza wasifu wako wa bure ukutane na watu waliothibitishwa walio makini "
"kuhusu ndoa."

#: templates/registration/signup.html:5
msgid "Jisajili &middot; Join free"
msgstr "Jisajili bure"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:5
msgid "Create your account"
msgstr "Tengeneza akaunti yako"

#: templates/registration/signup.html:5
msgid "It takes less than two minutes."
msgstr "Inachukua chini ya dakika mbili."

#: templates/registration/signup.html:8
msgid "Already a member?"
msgstr "Tayari ni mwanachama?"

#: templates/registration/verify.html:1 templates/registration/verify.html:5
msgid "Confirm your email"
msgstr "Thibitisha barua pepe yako"

#: templates/registration/verify.html:6
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We sent a 6-digit code to <b>%(email)s</b>. Enter it below, or tap the "
"button in the email."
msgstr ""
"Tumetuma code ya tarakimu 6 kwa <b>%(email)s</b>. Iweke hapa chini, au bofya"
" kitufe kilicho kwenye barua pepe."

#: templates/registration/verify.html:8
msgid "6-digit code"
msgstr "Code ya tarakimu 6"

#: templates/registration/verify.html:9
msgid "Confirm and continue"
msgstr "Thibitisha na uendelee"

#: templates/registration/verify.html:10
msgid ""
"Can't find it? Check your spam or promotions folder. The code works for 24 "
"hours."
msgstr ""
"Huioni? Angalia folda ya spam au promotions. Code inatumika kwa saa 24."

#: templates/registration/verify.html:12
msgid "Send a new code"
msgstr "Tuma code mpya"

#: templates/registration/verify.html:13
msgid "Wrong email address?"
msgstr "Barua pepe si sahihi?"

#: templates/registration/verify.html:15
msgid "Send the code there"
msgstr "Tuma code huko"

#: templates/registration/verify.html:17
msgid "Log out"
msgstr "Toka"

#: templates/registration/verify_email.html:8
#: templates/registration/verify_email.txt:3
msgid ""
"Welcome to Sakinah! To finish creating your account, enter this code on the "
"sign-up page:"
msgstr ""
"Karibu Sakinah! Ili kukamilisha akaunti yako, weka code hii kwenye ukurasa "
"wa usajili:"

#: templates/registration/verify_email.html:10
#: templates/registration/verify_email.txt:7
msgid "Or activate your account with one tap:"
msgstr "Au washa akaunti yako kwa kubofya mara moja:"

#: templates/registration/verify_email.html:11
msgid "Activate my account"
msgstr "Washa akaunti yangu"

#: templates/registration/verify_email.html:14
#: templates/registration/verify_email.txt:10
msgid ""
"The code and the link work for 24 hours. If you did not create an account, "
"you can ignore this email."
msgstr ""
"Code na kiungo vinatumika kwa saa 24. Kama hukutengeneza akaunti, unaweza "
"kupuuza barua pepe hii."

